{"id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md","title":"Direct Limit","display":"df-direct-limit — Direct Limit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-direct-limit","aliases":["58-df-direct-limit","Direct Limit","Colimit"],"display":"df-direct-limit — Direct Limit","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-direct-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-direct-limit</span><span>Direct Limit</span><span>Colimit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-direct-limit — Direct Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X,f,L,\\phi,\\leq_I,u,v\\in V\">\\(I,X,f,L,\\phi,\\leq_I,u,v\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i=X(i)\">\\(X_i=X(i)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{ij}=f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\">\\(f_{ij}=f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_i=\\phi(i)\">\\(\\phi_i=\\phi(i)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_i=g(i)\">\\(g_i=g(i)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\leq_Ij\">\\(i\\leq_Ij\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\">\\(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>族都是集合编码的函数；下式只要求覆盖实际使用的指标，保留额外但未被求值的指标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\\)</span> 的元数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4,6,6\">\\(4,6,6\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi:L\\to N\">\\(\\psi:L\\to N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{ij}:X_i\\to X_j\">\\(f_{ij}:X_i\\to X_j\\)</span> 均指内部函数谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\operatorname{dom}(X),\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;f_{ii}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X_i\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f_{ij},X_i,X_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\land j\\leq_Ik\\to f_{ik}=f_{jk}\\circ f_{ij}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\operatorname{dom}(X),\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;f_{ii}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X_i\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f_{ij},X_i,X_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\land j\\leq_Ik\\to f_{ik}=f_{jk}\\circ f_{ij}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S(u,v,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\operatorname{dom}(X),\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists i,j,k\\in I\\;\\exists x\\in X_i\\;\\exists y\\in X_j\\;\\bigl[\nu=\\langle i,x\\rangle\\land v=\\langle j,y\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land i\\leq_Ik\\land j\\leq_Ik\n\\land\\langle i,k\\rangle,\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_{ik},X_i,X_k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_{jk},X_j,X_k)\n\\land f_{ik}(x)=f_{jk}(y)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S(u,v,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\operatorname{dom}(X),\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists i,j,k\\in I\\;\\exists x\\in X_i\\;\\exists y\\in X_j\\;\\bigl[\nu=\\langle i,x\\rangle\\land v=\\langle j,y\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land i\\leq_Ik\\land j\\leq_Ik\n\\land\\langle i,k\\rangle,\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_{ik},X_i,X_k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_{jk},X_j,X_k)\n\\land f_{ik}(x)=f_{jk}(y)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S(L,\\phi,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,q\\;\\bigl[D=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in X_i\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,D,\\mathcal P(D))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;q(u)=\\{v\\in D:\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S(u,v,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\}\n\\land L=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,\\operatorname{dom}(\\phi),\\operatorname{ran}(\\phi))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\phi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi_i,X_i,L)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X_i\\;\\phi_i(x)=q(\\langle i,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall N,g\\;\\bigl[\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\operatorname{dom}(g),\\operatorname{ran}(g))\n\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Function}(g_i,X_i,N)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to g_i=g_j\\circ f_{ij})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists!\\psi\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\psi,L,N)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\psi\\circ\\phi_i=g_i\\bigr)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S(L,\\phi,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,q\\;\\bigl[D=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in X_i\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,D,\\mathcal P(D))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;q(u)=\\{v\\in D:\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S(u,v,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\}\n\\land L=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,\\operatorname{dom}(\\phi),\\operatorname{ran}(\\phi))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\phi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi_i,X_i,L)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X_i\\;\\phi_i(x)=q(\\langle i,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall N,g\\;\\bigl[\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\operatorname{dom}(g),\\operatorname{ran}(g))\n\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Function}(g_i,X_i,N)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to g_i=g_j\\circ f_{ij})\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists!\\psi\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\psi,L,N)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\psi\\circ\\phi_i=g_i\\bigr)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quotient, canonical maps, and universal property are clauses of one predicate; none is asserted without the direct-system hypotheses.</li>\n<li>In a general category the corresponding notion is the colimit; this atom gives the set-based construction.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weibel, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Directed}$ 取 [[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X,f,L,\\phi,\\leq_I,u,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X_i=X(i)","display":false},{"tex":"f_{ij}=f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_i=\\phi(i)","display":false},{"tex":"g_i=g(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\leq_Ij","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S","display":false},{"tex":"4,6,6","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi:L\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"f_{ij}:X_i\\to X_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\operatorname{dom}(X),\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(X)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;f_{ii}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X_i\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f_{ij},X_i,X_j))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\land j\\leq_Ik\\to f_{ik}=f_{jk}\\circ f_{ij}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S(u,v,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\operatorname{dom}(X),\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(X)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists i,j,k\\in I\\;\\exists x\\in X_i\\;\\exists y\\in X_j\\;\\bigl[\nu=\\langle i,x\\rangle\\land v=\\langle j,y\\rangle\\\\\n&\\quad\\land i\\leq_Ik\\land j\\leq_Ik\n\\land\\langle i,k\\rangle,\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_{ik},X_i,X_k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f_{jk},X_j,X_k)\n\\land f_{ik}(x)=f_{jk}(y)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S(L,\\phi,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists D,q\\;\\bigl[D=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in X_i\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,D,\\mathcal P(D))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;q(u)=\\{v\\in D:\\mathrm{DirectRelated}_S(u,v,X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\}\n\\land L=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,\\operatorname{dom}(\\phi),\\operatorname{ran}(\\phi))\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\phi)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi_i,X_i,L)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X_i\\;\\phi_i(x)=q(\\langle i,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall N,g\\;\\bigl[\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\operatorname{dom}(g),\\operatorname{ran}(g))\n\\land I\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Function}(g_i,X_i,N)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i\\leq_Ij\\to g_i=g_j\\circ f_{ij})\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\exists!\\psi\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\psi,L,N)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\psi\\circ\\phi_i=g_i\\bigr)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3594,"backlinks":[{"id":"2eaad590ac255c04","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S$ (direct-limit predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]])"},{"id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V$ is the strict-predecessor operator supplied by [[58-df-tree]], and $\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ is the exact six-place relation from [[58-df-direct-limit]]"},{"id":"76fb10ce5cb9e59d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S$ is the four-place set-system predicate from [[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]]"},{"id":"68fb21596025bb57","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Direct limits are defined separately in [[58-df-direct-limit]]"},{"id":"862f59a105f9b934","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S$ and $\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S$ are the exact predicates from [[58-df-direct-limit]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-431","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md|58-df-direct-limit]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["e61c089fc5e610a6","36d7463d215be751"]}